{"unit_id":"Anionex__dsh-computer-use#feature-1","repo":"Anionex/dsh-computer-use","commit":"d3fd041c15bba6e8859098e466c21e4186d1dbb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Computer Use 的功能「观察应用」：读取指定运行应用的 Accessibility 树，并可选返回截图。通过 computer_observe 触发，结果包含当前观察标识与界面元素。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:358-375"]}
{"unit_id":"Anionex__dsh-computer-use#feature-2","repo":"Anionex/dsh-computer-use","commit":"d3fd041c15bba6e8859098e466c21e4186d1dbb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Computer Use 的功能「操作界面」：点击元素、设置可编辑值、输入文字或发送按键。由对应的 computer_* 工具触发，动作根据观察结果定位应用界面。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:379-442"]}
{"unit_id":"Anionex__dsh-computer-use#feature-3","repo":"Anionex/dsh-computer-use","commit":"d3fd041c15bba6e8859098e466c21e4186d1dbb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Computer Use 的功能「滚动与拖动」：在观察到的应用中滚动内容或在两点之间拖动。调用 computer_scroll 或 computer_drag 并提供观察标识和方向或坐标。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:444-479"]}
{"unit_id":"Anionex__dsh-computer-use#feature-4","repo":"Anionex/dsh-computer-use","commit":"d3fd041c15bba6e8859098e466c21e4186d1dbb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Computer Use 的功能「等待界面条件」：等待 Accessibility 内容满足文本或元素条件，并返回新的状态。通过 computer_wait 提交观察标识、条件和可选超时。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:497-517"]}
{"unit_id":"Anionex__dsh-computer-use#feature-5","repo":"Anionex/dsh-computer-use","commit":"d3fd041c15bba6e8859098e466c21e4186d1dbb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Computer Use 的功能「管理设置」：在 Web 设置页查看运行状态与权限状态、调整配置并重新检查健康状态。通过 Computer Use 设置界面保存或应用更改。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/web.ts:138-152","src/web.ts:155-188","src/client/index.tsx:29-35"]}
